  "details": "Due to the new placement of the chatbox being above the nameplate rather than below, it is very common for the chatbox to be covered up by the nameplate itself when standing very close to someone. This is already a problem for avatars with slight height differences like I've experienced, but is a huge problem when you consider how common drastic height differences are in VRChat.",
